# Build context of the api / worker / jobs images is the repository root (they need apps/api
# and the monorepo rules/). Admit only those; everything else (console node_modules, mobile,
# infra, docs, .env files, .claude worktrees) stays out of the context.
*
!apps/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/api/uv.lock
!apps/api/.python-version
!apps/api/README.md
!apps/api/alembic.ini
!apps/api/alembic
!apps/api/farmerapp
!rules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
